### ============================================================
### Attachments
### Upload = multipart/form-data (file wajib)
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = {{baseUrl}}
@token = {{token}}
@attachmentId = 1

### List attachments
GET {{baseUrl}}/attachments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by attachable
GET {{baseUrl}}/attachments?attachable_type=App\Models\ItemUnit&attachable_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by type
GET {{baseUrl}}/attachments?type=condition_after
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Show attachment
GET {{baseUrl}}/attachments/{{attachmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Download attachment (binary)
GET {{baseUrl}}/attachments/{{attachmentId}}/download
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Upload attachment
# Ganti path file lokal di baris File sebelum run.
# Di kulala: pastikan multipart fields terisi.
POST {{baseUrl}}/attachments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----KulalaBoundary

------KulalaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="attachable_type"

App\Models\ItemUnit
------KulalaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="attachable_id"

1
------KulalaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="type"

condition_after
------KulalaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Foto kondisi setelah return
------KulalaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

isi file contoh untuk uji upload
------KulalaBoundary--

### Delete attachment
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/attachments/{{attachmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
